WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
In 1508, Pope Julius the Second asked
Michelangelo to paint the ceiling of the

2
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.810
Sistine Chapel.

3
00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:10.300
Down the centre, he painted
nine scenes from Genesis,

4
00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:12.990
from light and darkness to Noah.

5
00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:17.830
In one, Adam lies on bare
earth, his hand hanging limp.

6
00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:20.910
Across the sky, another hand reaches out.

7
00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.320
The fingers almost touch.

8
00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:27.620
Why do Catholics say that tiny
gap shows what a human is?

9
00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.860
In this mission, you'll read
the painting zone by zone,

10
00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:32.970
and test it against Genesis.

11
00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:37.480
Then you'll weigh up whether any
painting can show an invisible God.

12
00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:42.370
Your mission: explain what Catholics
see in the gap between two fingers.
